        f"{E_DOT} {E_SETTINGS} **Utility / Autoresponders**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_SETTINGS} **General**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_SEC} **Moderation**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_SETTINGS} **Autoroles & Automations**\n\n"
        f"**Modules (Part 2)**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_DOT} **Greetings**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_UPTIME} **Logging**\n"
        f"{E_DOT} {E_SETTINGS} **Bot Settings**"
